# Personal Claude Code overrides; project settings.json is committed
.claude/settings.local.json

# Local copies made while deploying — a hand-edited compose file, an image or
# source tarball built to move onto the server. They are snapshots of a moment,
# not sources, and the tarballs are large enough that one careless `git add -A`
# would put a hundred megabytes in the history permanently.
*.backup
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# Signing material for the Android app. The platform's own .gitignore comments
# these out by default, which is the wrong default for a repository that is
# pushed anywhere: a leaked upload key cannot be rotated without losing the
# ability to update an installed app.
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore.properties
